1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,560
I'd like to welcome you all to the annual golf championship, and I hope that you enjoy the week you will be spending with us.

2
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:15,040
I would like to remind you that, due to security arrangements, it is essential to have your press identification cards with you at all times.

3
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:19,040
If you forget your card, you will not be allowed to enter any press area.

4
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:23,140
Press conferences will be held at the end of play every day.

5
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:27,775
All reporters will be able to question the selected competitors in the press room.

6
00:00:28,335 --> 00:00:31,160
Please indicate that you have a question by raising your hand.

7
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:35,180
A tournament official will pass you a microphone when it is your turn.

8
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:40,250
And please ensure that your mobile phones are off during question sessions.
